{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FboTXbFujs1794206491.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>荃灣有七人車懷疑失控，撞向巴士站及巴士，兩名司機受傷送院。</p><p></p><p>涉事七人車車頭嚴重凹陷，整輛車撞到掉頭，右邊車身亦損毀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TW-1300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202648dzfh0UoL1794205065.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>事發在上午約11時，一輛七人車沿青山公路往屯門方向行駛，到南豐中心對出時懷疑分心突然向左駛，撞向路牌、巴士站牌，再撞到前面一輛巴士。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TW-1300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lTzBp57FuB1794205059.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>59歲巴士司機及66歲七人車司機，分別頸痛及四肢擦損，送仁濟醫院治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.493264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T04:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:17:08.970482+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.656156+00:00","content_hash":"be924ce849c7603a75fb72b527ca84f16288c47452327f4c8260fcb0132fb363","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.493264+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}